                {
                  "id": "MDE3OkRpc2N1c3Npb25Db21tZW50NzQ3OTAz",
                  "databaseId": 747903,
                  "body": "After some hassle, I managed to set it up.\r\n\r\nI added newrelic as an external webpack dependency in nuxt.config.js\r\n```javascript\r\n    extend (config, ctx) {\r\n      config.externals = [\r\n        { newrelic: 'newrelic' }\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd then in nuxtServerInit I set the transaction name with code split so the bundle doesn't break in client side\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\nasync nuxtServerInit ({ dispatch, commit }, context) {\r\n    const newrelic = await import('newrelic')\r\n    newrelic.setTransactionName(context.route.matched[0].path)\r\n}\r\n```",
                  "createdAt": "2020-04-27T11:54:42Z",
                  "url": "https://github.com/nuxt/nuxt/discussions/9303#discussioncomment-747903",
                  "author": {
                    "__typename": "User",
